        "type": "text",
        "version": 1,
        "data": {
          "format": "plain",
          "locale": "mixed",
          "text": "Barber shop / Hairdresser\nWord\tMeaning\nbarber shop\tآرایشگاه مردانه، معمولاً برای مو و ریش\nhair salon\tسالن آرایش\nhairdresser\tآرایشگر / آرایشگاه\nthe hairdresser's\tآرایشگاه\n\nنکته:\n\nthe hairdresser's\n\nعلامت 's اینجا مالکیت واقعی نیست؛ به یک place associated with a person/profession اشاره می‌کند.\n\nمثال:\n\nI went to the hairdresser's yesterday.",
          "role": "assistant-source"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "block-original-2a091de6-2bbf-4f90-8607-d023e02d65aa-5",
        "type": "text",
        "version": 1,
        "data": {
          "format": "plain",
          "locale": "mixed",
          "text": "اصلاح جمله‌ی جزوه\n\n❌ He want to the hairdressers'.\n✅ He went to the hairdresser's.",
          "role": "assistant-source"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "block-original-2a091de6-2bbf-4f90-8607-d023e02d65aa-6",
        "type": "text",
        "version": 1,
        "data": {
