        "type": "text",
        "version": 1,
        "data": {
          "format": "plain",
          "locale": "mixed",
          "text": "frustrated\n\nfrustrated = کلافه / ناامید\n\nشخصی که آن احساس را دارد:\n\nI was frustrated.\n\nاین تفاوت مهم است:\n\nThe situation was frustrating.\nI was frustrated.",
          "role": "assistant-source"
