        "type": "text",
        "version": 1,
        "data": {
          "format": "plain",
          "locale": "mixed",
          "text": "give up\n\ngive up = تسلیم شدن / دست کشیدن از کاری\n\nمثال:\n\nI gave up and came home.\n\nیعنی:\n\n«بی‌خیال شدم و برگشتم خانه.»",
          "role": "assistant-source"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "block-original-2a091de6-2bbf-4f90-8607-d023e02d65aa-26",
        "type": "text",
        "version": 1,
        "data": {
          "format": "plain",
          "locale": "mixed",
          "text": "Grammar\n\ngive → present\ngave → past\n\nپس:\n\nI gave up.\n\nنه:\n\n❌ I give up.\n\nاگر درباره‌ی گذشته صحبت می‌کنیم.",
          "role": "assistant-source"
        }
      },
